<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26995" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δί-κροος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκρους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ουν;</span> or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικρόος</span></b> , 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικροῦς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾶ</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, οῦν;</span> also written
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forked, cloven,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλώσσημα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					152
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				10.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Timocl.
					9.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χηλή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					590b25
				</span></i>
			, etc.; of a serpent's tongue, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>PA</u>
				660b6
			</span></i>, al.; of the womb, in selachians, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>HA</u>
				511a6
			</span></i>; of muscles and tendons, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.369
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκρα ῥίζα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					9.11.3
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικροῖς ἐώθουν τὴν
				θεὸν—κεκράγμασιν </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ προσδοκίαν</span> for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξύλοις</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				637
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δίκρουν</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικροῦν, τό,</span>
			<i>bifurcation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Coac.</u>
			</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				225
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				78b
			</span></i>; also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δικρόα, ἡ,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyn.</u>
				9.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				2.6.9
			</span></i>.</div>
